});
```

That's a reasonable test for the new shape. Import `FailurePresentation` instead of `UserFacingFailure` (UserFacingFailure is still exported and used as the type for kind — the test file no longer needs it unless used elsewhere; check line 7 of the test: `type UserFacingFailure` is imported and used only on line 18 for EXPECTED. I'll swap the import to FailurePresentation).

